 "<i>Double Poke in the Eye II</i>, 1985 — neon": "〈戳眼睛兩下 II〉，1985 — 霓虹",
 "Neon": "霓虹",
 "<i>From Hand to Mouth</i>, 1967 — wax over cloth": "〈從手到口〉，1967 — 布上覆蠟",
